      "title": "① 紅框節點=你要改的地方 / Red-framed nodes to edit",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n紅框的兩個 `LoadVideo` 就是你要改的地方：\n\n- 把自己的影片直接拖到節點上（或拖到畫布上再連進去）就能上傳，\n  或用下拉選單選平台暫存區裡已經有的檔案。\n- **兩段影片建議用相同的解析度與 fps**：不同解析度接起來畫面會跑掉或報錯，\n  fps 不同的話聲音、畫面對不上。\n\n其他節點不用動。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nThe two red `LoadVideo` nodes are the only thing you need to touch: drag\nyour own clip onto the node (or onto the canvas, then wire it up) to upload\nit, or pick an already-staged file from the dropdown.\n**Use the same resolution and fps for both clips** — mismatched resolutions\ndistort or error out, and mismatched fps drifts audio out of sync."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        720,
        -480
      ],
      "size": [
        320,
        420
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 10,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "② 中段在做什麼 / What the middle section does",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n把兩段影片的畫面接起來，聲音也接起來，最後合成一支新影片。\n\n`GetVideoComponents` 把每段影片拆成畫面、聲音、fps 三樣東西；\n`ImageBatch` 接畫面，`AudioConcat` 接聲音，`CreateVideo` 再把兩者合回一支影片\n（fps 直接沿用影片 1 的 fps）。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\nJoins the two clips' pictures and their audio, then muxes the result back\ninto one video. `GetVideoComponents` splits each clip into frames, audio and\nfps; `ImageBatch` and `AudioConcat` join those tracks; `CreateVideo` reunites\nthem (using clip 1's fps)."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1060,
