      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "③ 輸出 / Output",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**繁體中文**\n\n`SaveVideo` 的 `filename_prefix`（預設 `comfyfed_concat`）可以改成你想要的檔名前綴。\n按右上角 Run 之後，這會變成一個聯邦 job；完成後結果會自動回傳到平台，\n影片也會直接在 `SaveVideo` 節點裡播放，Console 的「工作」頁面也拿得到檔案。\n\n---\n\n**English**\n\n`SaveVideo`'s `filename_prefix` (default `comfyfed_concat`) can be changed to\nwhatever prefix you like. Press Run and this becomes a federation job; the\nresult is automatically reported back to the platform once it finishes, the\nclip plays inside the `SaveVideo` node, and it is also listed on the\nconsole's Jobs page."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
